***************************
* SET UP THE INITIAL DATA *
***************************

NAME          BENCHOPT

*   Problem :
*   *********

*   Custom benchmark optimization problem for evaluation.
*   Minimize (x1-1)^2 + 4*(x2-2)^2 + 3*x1*x2
*   Subject to x1 + x2 >= 2
*   Bounds: -10 <= xi <= 10

*   classification QLR2-AN-2-1

VARIABLES

    X1
    X2

GROUPS

 N  OBJ1      X1        1.0
 N  OBJ2      X2        1.0
 N  OBJ2      'SCALE'   0.25
 N  OBJ3
 G  CON1      X1        1.0            X2        1.0

CONSTANTS

    BENCHOPT  OBJ1      1.0
    BENCHOPT  OBJ2      2.0
    BENCHOPT  CON1      2.0

BOUNDS

 LO BENCHOPT  'DEFAULT' -10.0
 UP BENCHOPT  'DEFAULT' 10.0

START POINT

    BENCHOPT  X1        0.0
    BENCHOPT  X2        0.0

ELEMENT TYPE

 EV 2PR       V1                       V2

ELEMENT USES

 T  E1        2PR
 V  E1        V1                       X1
 V  E1        V2                       X2

GROUP TYPE

 GV L2        GVAR

GROUP USES

 T  OBJ1      L2
 T  OBJ2      L2
 E  OBJ3      E1        3.0

OBJECT BOUND

*LO SOLTN               -1.0

ENDATA

***********************
* SET UP THE FUNCTION *
* AND RANGE ROUTINES  *
***********************

ELEMENTS      BENCHOPT

INDIVIDUALS

 T  2PR
 F                      V1 * V2
 G  V1                  V2
 G  V2                  V1
 H  V1        V2        1.0

ENDATA

*********************
* SET UP THE GROUPS *
* ROUTINE           *
*********************

GROUPS        BENCHOPT

INDIVIDUALS

 T  L2
 F                      GVAR * GVAR
 G                      GVAR + GVAR
 H                      2.0

ENDATA
